    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>An auxiliary power-routing module that primes the kinetic barrier emitters the instant fire slackens, eliminating the lag between a hit and the start of the recharge cycle.</p><p>Your kinetic barrier normally waits <strong>one full round</strong> after taking damage before it begins recharging. This module removes that delay — your barrier resumes recharging on your next turn, even if it was hit on the previous round.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> - Install in armor during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p><hr/><p><em>Installation: Drag it onto armor in your inventory to install it. Its bonus applies while the armor it is installed in is worn. </em></p>"
